en the children moved to a different room.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026236106","facility_name":"Creative Action After School at Reilly Elementary"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1200898-i20220718-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-744-2601","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1200898-i20220718","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1200898","date":"2022-07-18","original_code":"744.2601","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-07-28","finding":"Safety - Areas Free From Hazards: The gate to the fence surrounding the a/c unit was unlocked making the a/c unit accessible to children. This was corrected at inspection as the operation staff zip tied the gate to the fence to prevent children's access. The door to the storage room with cleaning supplies was observed unlocked. This was corrected at inspection as the staff locked the door. A spray bottle of Clorox and mouth wash was observed accessible to children in a restroom. This was corrected at inspection as these items were removed from the reach of children.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026316373","facility_name":"Reach Center"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-141572-i20220615-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-744-2601","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-141572-i20220615","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-141572","date":"2022-06-15","original_code":"744.2601","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-06-27","finding":"Safety - Areas Free From Hazards: During naptime, a child was lying on a cot near a table. There were chairs sitting on top of the table. The child was messing with one of the chairs and one ended up falling on the child. The child sustained a cut slightly beneath his left eyebrow. The child required stitches.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026681844","facility_name":"YMCA Central"},{"id":"tx